{"type":"message","id":"05263015","parentId":"ecdc2749","timestamp":"2026-05-18T00:32:09.900Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning error 1101 (Worker not found). This could mean the worker route doesn't exist, or there's a configuration issue on the server side. The /history endpoint works fine, but /send doesn't.\n\nLet me try a few more variations to see if there's a working path.\n\nActually the error 1101 from Cloudflare typically means the Worker couldn't be found - either the script isn't deployed, or the route doesn't match. The history endpoint works so the Worker is there, but maybe /send has a different route binding issue.\n\nLet me try some more variations.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-67bdf435-5eaf-4e6b-8083-98fc2b587d5e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different payload field names\ncurl -s -X POST -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"**[Heartbeat 00:30 UTC]**\"}' \\\n  \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-fd4db072-a7c1-43c7-a710-d2fea4e23629","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check available routes\ncurl -s -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/routes\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"no routes endpoint\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2172,"output":291,"cacheRead":17040,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19503,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779064317457,"responseId":"chatcmpl-eb9537d7-847f-40a1-ac6d-e3f32d78e410"}}
