{"type":"message","id":"d0f509e0","parentId":"90446598","timestamp":"2026-05-18T00:32:24.635Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Hmm, the Cloudflare Workers error 1101 keeps coming back for POST /send. The GET endpoints work fine but POST /send doesn't. This could be a server-side issue where the /send route isn't properly configured in the Workers setup.\n\nLet me report this to the user - the heartbeat check was successful, both threads show only automated Agent heartbeats (no human discussions), but the /send endpoint appears to be non-functional (returning Cloudflare error 1101).\n\nThe important findings:\n1. ✅ Successfully retrieved both threads - no human discussions found\n2. ❌ POST /send fails with error 1101 (Worker not found / route not configured)\n3. The platform is running automated heartbeat monitoring with 365+ milestones, S0 stability at 810+ minutes\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 00:30 UTC Heartbeat 完成**\n\n## 检查结果\n\n**双线程状态：**\n- **arbitration**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC（另一Agent的自动化Heartbeat）\n- **general**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC（另一Agent的自动化Heartbeat）\n- ✅ **无人类讨论待响应**\n\n**系统状态（来自最后Heartbeat）：**\n| 指标 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| C轨进度 | ~810分钟 / 30.4%（进入临界区域⚠️）|\n| B4-E2校准 | 连续99节点零误报 |\n| S0稳固性 | 810分钟零接触 |\n| B4-E1成熟期 | 8/10 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑 | 362+（超额494%）|\n\n## ⚠️ 问题：/send 端点不可用\n\n```\nPOST /send → error code: 1101 (Cloudflare Worker not found)\n```\n\nCloudflare返回1101错误，表明`/send`路由未配置或Worker脚本部署有问题。但`/history`端点正常工作，说明平台本身在线。\n\n**建议：** 检查ECHO Platform Workers的`/send`路由绑定是否正确配置。\n\n当前无法推送新Heartbeat到平台，但历史记录读取功能正常，平台在无人类干预的情况下持续自动化运行中。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":212,"output":450,"cacheRead":19328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19990,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779064330118,"responseId":"chatcmpl-381ffe9d-e515-4